graph TD
    A[Nascent Protein Release] --> B[Chaperone Recognition]
    B --> C[Hsp70 Binding]
    C --> D[ATP Hydrolysis]
    D --> E[Protein Unfolding]
    E --> F[Correct Folding Attempt]
    F --> G{Properly Folded?}
    G -->|No| H[Refolding Cycle]
    H --> C
    
    G -->|Yes| I[Chaperone Release]
    I --> J[Protein Folding Complete]
    J --> K[Functional Protein]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> L[Spontaneous Folding]
    L --> M[Intrinsic Folding]
    M --> N{Stable Structure?}
    N -->|Yes| K
    N -->|No| O[Misfolded Protein]
    O --> P[Aggregation Prevention]
    P --> Q[Proteasome Targeting]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[Hsp70] --> C
    S[Hsp90] --> B
    T[Hsp60] --> B
    U[ATP] --> D
    V[ADP] --> D
    W[Proteasome] --> Q
    
